msgid "Define the number of days that you want to get the full EPG data, reducing this number can help you to save memory usage on your box. But you are also limited with the EPG provider available data. You will not have 15 days EPG if it only provide 7 days data."
msgstr "To'liq EPG ma'lumotlarini olishni istagan kunlar sonini belgilang, bu raqamni kamaytirish qutingizdagi xotira sarfini tejashga yordam beradi. Ammo siz EPG provayderi mavjud ma'lumotlar bilan ham cheklangansiz. Agar u faqat 7 kunlik ma'lumotlarni taqdim etsa, sizda 15 kunlik EPG bo'lmaydi."

