msgid "Specify in which case the EPG must be automatically updated after the box has booted."
msgstr "Qaysi holatda quti yuklangandan keyin EPG avtomatik ravishda yangilanishi kerakligini ko'rsating."

msgid "Specify the path folder for save EPG.dat file."
msgstr "EPG.dat faylini saqlash uchun yo'l papkasini belgilang."

msgid "Specify the source for EPG."
msgstr "EPG manbasini belgilang."

msgid "Specify the time for the automatic EPG update."
msgstr "Avtomatik EPG yangilanish vaqtini belgilang."

msgid "Standby at startup"
msgstr "Ishga tushganda kutish holati"

msgid "Start import after booting up"
msgstr "Yuklashdan keyin importni boshlang"

