msgstr "Kutish rejimidan qaytgandan so'ng importni boshlang."

msgid "Start import after standby"
msgstr "Kutish rejimidan keyin import qilishni boshlang"

msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "yakshanba"

msgid "The waked up box will be turned into standby after automatic EPG import wake up."
msgstr "Uyg'otilgan quti avtomatik ravishda EPG importi uyg'onganidan keyin kutish rejimiga aylanadi."

msgid "This is for advanced users that are using the channel id filtering feature. If enabled, the filter rules defined into /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf will also be applied on your /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml file."
msgstr "Bu kanal identifikatorini filtrlash funksiyasidan foydalanayotgan ilg‘or foydalanuvchilar uchun. Agar yoqilgan bo'lsa, /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf faylida belgilangan filtr qoidalari /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml faylingizda ham qo'llaniladi."

msgid "This will clear the current EPG data in memory before updating the EPG data. This allows you to always have a clean new EPG with the latest EPG data, for example in case of program changes between refresh, otherwise EPG data are cumulative."
msgstr "Bu EPG ma'lumotlarini yangilashdan oldin xotiradagi joriy EPG ma'lumotlarini tozalaydi. Bu sizga har doim eng so'nggi EPG ma'lumotlari bilan toza yangi EPGga ega bo'lish imkonini beradi, masalan, yangilash oralig'ida dastur o'zgargan taqdirda, aks holda EPG ma'lumotlari yig'ilib qoladi."

msgid "This will turn back waked up box into deep-standby after automatic EPG import."
msgstr "Bu avtomatik EPG importidan keyin uyg'ongan qutini chuqur kutish rejimiga qaytaradi."

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "Payshanba"

msgid "To save memory you can decide to load EPG data only  for theIPTV channels."
msgstr "Xotirani saqlash uchun siz faqat IPTV kanallari uchun EPG maʼlumotlarini yuklashga qaror qilishingiz mumkin."

msgid "To save memory you can decide to only load EPG data for the services that you have in your bouquet files."
msgstr "Xotirani saqlash uchun siz faqat guldasta fayllaringizdagi xizmatlar uchun EPG maʼlumotlarini yuklashga qaror qilishingiz mumkin."

msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "seshanba"

msgid "Update Sources"
msgstr "Manbalarni yangilash"

msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "chorshanba"

msgid "When enabled, it allows you to schedule an automatic EPG update at the given days and time."
msgstr "Agar yoqilgan bo'lsa, u sizga belgilangan kun va vaqtda avtomatik EPG yangilanishini rejalashtirish imkonini beradi."

msgid "When enabled, then you can run the desired script before starting the import, after which the import of the EPG will begin."
msgstr "Agar yoqilgan bo'lsa, importni boshlashdan oldin kerakli skriptni ishga tushirishingiz mumkin, shundan so'ng EPG importi boshlanadi."

msgid "When in deep standby"
msgstr "Chuqur kutish holatida"

#, fuzzy
msgid "When you decide to import the EPG after the box booted mention if the \\\\\\\\"
msgstr "Quti yuklangandan keyin EPGni import qilishga qaror qilganingizda, agar \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"

msgid "When you restart the GUI you can decide to skip or not the EPG data import."
msgstr "GUI-ni qayta ishga tushirganingizda, EPG ma'lumotlarini import qilishni o'tkazib yuborish yoki qilmaslik haqida qaror qabul qilishingiz mumkin."

msgid "Write to /tmp/epgimport.log"
msgstr "/tmp/epgimport.log saytiga yozing"

msgid "You can select the day(s) when the EPG update must be performed."
msgstr "EPG yangilanishi amalga oshirilishi kerak bo'lgan kun(lar)ni tanlashingiz mumkin."

msgid "You can start automatically the plugin AutoTimer after the EPG data update to have it refreshing its scheduling after EPG data refresh."
msgstr "EPG ma'lumotlari yangilangandan so'ng uning jadvalini yangilash uchun siz avtomatik ravishda AutoTimer plaginini ishga tushirishingiz mumkin."

